<title>MONGOLIA: Mongolia currency up 0.005 pct vs dollar in week.</title>
<headline>Mongolia currency up 0.005 pct vs dollar in week.</headline>
<dateline>ULAN BATOR 1997-06-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mongolia's tugrik strengthened 0.005 percent against the dollar on Monday compared with the previous Monday, central bank figures showed.</p>
<p>The Bank of Mongolia official rate for the tugrik was up to 797.99 against the U.S. currency on Monday from 798.03 the previous Monday.</p>
<p>The central bank calculates the official rate based on the previous week's interbank trade.</p>
<p>-- Ulan Bator newsroom (976-10-312565)</p>
